commits 72683931ca0fad512dec2967e3362362cf07e5a0 (2026-09-19) and
f1dd16688826e8005b7d71a14a1b4bacc3e74cfd (2026-09-26), and re-expressed in
this repository's shared credentials loader and window-based quota contract:
the winning login's directory also owns the device identity file and the
OAuth refresh lock, keyed windows reuse the existing window ids for the same
periods, hybrid responses deduplicate by window id, and monthly ratios render
as local quota windows with a matching notice instead of upstream's separate
meter list. The daemon source-location contract additionally captures
KIMI_SHARE_DIR so the background service resolves the same login; upstream's
